# Repo-pinned line endings: git blob = canonical LF (cross-node receipt law).
# Removes dependence on per-machine core.autocrlf (PC=true, laptop may differ).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.bz2 binary
*.xz binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
